<title>USA: IBAH names CFO, chief oper officer.</title>
<headline>IBAH names CFO, chief oper officer.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBAH Inc said on Thursday that it appointed Leonard Stigliano chief operating officer and Cornelius Lansing chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Stigliano joined IBAH in 1995 as the chief financial officer, IBAH said.</p>
<p>Lansing is joining IBAH with extensive business experience from Dun &amp; Bradstreet Corp and ACNielsen, IBAH said.</p>
<p>IBAH said in a separate statement that it also appointed Rudi Weekers to the position of president of the company's International CRO business.</p>
</text>
